────────────────────────
Key columns & why they matter
────────────────────────
• PATENTS_USPTO.USPTO_OCE_CLAIMS.PATENT_CLAIMS_STATS  
  – "pat_no"                 : patent number to link into MATCH  
  – "claim_no"               : the claim number you finally need  
  – "word_ct"                : word‑count metric you will sort on  
  – "ind_flg"                : = '1' keeps only independent claims  

• PATENTS_USPTO.USPTO_OCE_CLAIMS.MATCH  
  – "pat_no"                 : join key coming from PATENT_CLAIMS_STATS  
  – "publication_number"     : normalised publication number (e.g. US‑2014007891‑A1)  

• PATENTS_USPTO.PATENTS.PUBLICATIONS  
  – "publication_number"     : join key coming from MATCH  
  – "application_number"     : lets us group by application  
  – "publication_date"       : used to pick the earliest publication in each application family  

